# Playground

## Editor

- Lazy-load CodeMirror (`CodeEditor` chunk) — never ship it in the catalogue bundle
- Recompose srcdoc on a **300ms debounce**; never remount the iframe on keystroke
- Seed drafts with the reduced-motion-ready starter in `starter.ts`

## Persistence

- Debounced `localStorage` under `playground:draft:{id}` (+ draft index key)
- Share: lz-string-compress `{ html, css, js, controls }` into the URL hash
- Draft rail: new / duplicate / rename / delete

## Export

- Zip via **fflate** (not jszip)
- Form validates slug id uniqueness against the registry
- Include `demo.css` + `demo.style.txt`, scaffolded `spec.md` / `contract.json` with TODOs
- Zip README lists the two manual steps: drop folder + one `index.ts` line
